{% liquid
assign form_id = 'WeldselectInquiry-' | append: section.id
assign machine_names = 'LZ-1500F-3000F Handheld Laser Welding Machine' | split: ','
assign machine = all_products['lz-f-3-in-1-handheld-laser-welding-machine']
%}<div class="dd-weldselect">
<section class="dd-weldselect__hero"><div class="dd-weldselect__wrap"><nav class="dd-weldselect__crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Laser Welding Machines</span></nav><div class="dd-weldselect__split"><div><p class="dd-weldselect__eyebrow">PLAN AROUND YOUR MATERIAL &amp; JOINT</p><h1>Handheld Laser Welding Machines for Metal Fabrication</h1><p class="dd-weldselect__lead">Explore the LZ-1500F-3000F series for your metal joining requirements. Match the power, wire-feeding arrangement and accessories to your parts through sample testing.</p><div class="dd-weldselect__actions"><a class="dd-weldselect__button" href="{{ machine.url }}">View Machine &amp; Specifications</a><a href="#WeldselectContact">Get Welding Advice →</a></div><p class="dd-weldselect__note">1500W · 2000W · 3000W | Free sample testing · Technical support</p></div><figure>{{ machine.featured_image | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag: widths: '400,700,1000', sizes: '(min-width:900px) 46vw, 100vw', loading: 'eager', fetchpriority: 'high', alt: 'LZ-1500F-3000F handheld laser welding machine with wire feeder' }}<figcaption>LZ-1500F-3000F series. Supplied configuration and accessories are confirmed in your quotation.</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>
<section class="dd-weldselect__section"><div class="dd-weldselect__wrap"><h2>Start with the parts you need to join</h2><div class="dd-weldselect__grid"><article class="dd-weldselect__panel"><h3>Sheet-metal assemblies</h3><p>Review joints for fabricated panels, enclosures and metal components using your actual material and drawings.</p></article><article class="dd-weldselect__panel"><h3>Frames & metal furniture</h3><p>Share frame dimensions, joint access and appearance requirements to assess the proposed welding setup.</p></article><article class="dd-weldselect__panel"><h3>Metal signs & decorative work</h3><p>Evaluate visible seams and finishing requirements for lettering, signs and decorative assemblies with a sample test.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="dd-weldselect__section dd-weldselect__tint"><div class="dd-weldselect__wrap"><p class="dd-weldselect__eyebrow">FEATURED SERIES</p><h2>LZ-1500F-3000F: three power options, a job-specific setup</h2><p>Choose 1500W, 2000W or 3000W. Confirm the welding head, wire feeder, shielding gas, cooling and site electrical requirements around your application. Welding, cleaning and cutting accessories should be specified in the quotation.</p><div class="dd-weldselect__two"><figure>{{ images['laser-welding-process-sample.jpg'] | image_url: width: 800 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: 'Handheld laser welding process from our demonstration video', class: 'weld-sample' }}<figcaption>Welding demonstration</figcaption></figure><figure>{{ images['laser-welding-stainless-joint-sample.jpg'] | image_url: width: 800 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: 'Metal joint shown in our welding demonstration', class: 'weld-sample' }}<figcaption>Joint result</figcaption></figure></div><p class="dd-weldselect__note">Frames from our welding demonstration video. Results depend on power, material, joint preparation and process settings.</p><a class="dd-weldselect__button" href="{{ machine.url }}">View Product &amp; Get a Quote</a></div></section>
<section class="dd-weldselect__section"><div class="dd-weldselect__wrap"><h2>Four details for your welding proposal</h2><div class="dd-weldselect__two"><article class="dd-weldselect__panel"><h3>01 · Material & thickness</h3><p>Specify the metal grade, surface condition and thickness of both parts to be joined.</p></article><article class="dd-weldselect__panel"><h3>02 · Joint design & access</h3><p>Send drawings or close-up photos of the joint, fit-up and areas the operator needs to reach.</p></article><article class="dd-weldselect__panel"><h3>03 · Finish & output</h3><p>Describe the required weld appearance, downstream finishing and production volume.</p></article><article class="dd-weldselect__panel"><h3>04 · Workshop & equipment</h3><p>Share the available electrical supply, shielding gas arrangements and installation space. Confirm cooling, accessories and training in the proposal.</p></article></div><a class="dd-weldselect__button" href="#WeldselectContact">Request a Free Sample Test</a></div></section>
<section class="dd-weldselect__section dd-weldselect__tint"><div class="dd-weldselect__wrap dd-weldselect__split"><div><h2>Connect welding with your production workflow</h2><p>For sheet-metal parts that need to be cut before assembly, explore <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}collections/fiber-laser-cutting">Fiber Laser Cutting Machines</a>.</p><p>For signs and lettering, see our <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/industry-sign">Signage Production Solutions</a> and discuss the combination of processes your products require.</p><p>Equipment configuration, delivery and technical support arrangements are confirmed for your order.</p></div><div class="dd-weldselect__faq"><h2>Laser Welding Questions</h2><details><summary>Which power should I choose?</summary><p>Choose from 1500W, 2000W and 3000W based on the material grade, thickness, joint geometry and required weld result. Send representative parts or drawings for a free sample test before confirming the setup.</p></details><details><summary>What materials and thicknesses can I weld?</summary><p>Share the exact metal grade, thickness and joint preparation. Suitability and weld quality must be checked for your application; power alone does not establish a guaranteed thickness or finish.</p></details><details><summary>Does the machine also clean and cut?</summary><p>The series offers welding, cleaning and cutting functions. Confirm the required head accessories, consumables and setup for each function in your quotation. For sheet nesting and shaped parts, review a dedicated fiber laser cutting machine.</p></details><details><summary>What should the quotation include?</summary><p>Confirm the laser power, welding head, wire-feeding arrangement, shielding gas requirements, cooling, electrical supply and supplied accessories. Installation and operator training arrangements should match your workshop.</p></details><details><summary>Can you provide sample testing and overseas support?</summary><p>We provide free sample testing, English manuals and videos, remote installation training and technical support. Equipment-specific spare parts are prepared for each machine. On-site support can be arranged. Sample shipping and delivery timing are agreed separately for each order.</p></details></div></div></section>
  <section class="dd-weldselect__section" id="WeldselectContact"><div class="dd-weldselect__wrap dd-weldselect__split"><div><p class="dd-weldselect__eyebrow">TELL US WHAT YOU WANT TO MAKE</p><h2>Get an equipment proposal for your metal welding application</h2><p>Share your material, thickness, finished size and production requirements. We will help you plan the equipment and a free sample test.</p><p><a href="mailto:info@gzcnc-laser.com">info@gzcnc-laser.com</a><br><a href="https://wa.me/8618988946615">WhatsApp: +86 189 8894 6615</a></p><p class="dd-weldselect__note">Need to share artwork or photos? Send them by email or WhatsApp. Name, email and message are required.</p></div>
    {% form 'contact', id: form_id %}
      <input type="hidden" name="contact[Source]" value="Laser welding category">
      {% if form.posted_successfully? %}<div class="dd-weldselect__success" role="status" tabindex="-1" data-weldselect-success><strong>Thank you — your inquiry has been sent.</strong><p>Our team will review your requirements and contact you by email. You do not need to submit the same inquiry again.</p></div><dialog data-weldselect-dialog aria-labelledby="WeldselectSuccessTitle"><h2 id="WeldselectSuccessTitle">Inquiry sent successfully</h2><p>Thank you for contacting Dragon Diamond. Our team will review your requirements and contact you by email.</p><button type="button" class="dd-weldselect__button" data-weldselect-close>Got it</button></dialog>{% endif %}
      {% if form.errors %}<div role="alert">{{ form.errors | default_errors }}</div>{% endif %}
      <div class="dd-weldselect__fields"><div><label for="WeldselectName-{{ section.id }}">Name *</label><input id="WeldselectName-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[name]" autocomplete="name" value="{{ form.name | escape }}" required></div><div><label for="WeldselectEmail-{{ section.id }}">Email *</label><input id="WeldselectEmail-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[email]" type="email" autocomplete="email" value="{{ form.email | escape }}" required></div><div><label for="WeldselectCompany-{{ section.id }}">Company</label><input id="WeldselectCompany-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[Company]" autocomplete="organization" value="{{ form.Company | escape }}"></div><div><label for="WeldselectWA-{{ section.id }}">WhatsApp</label><input id="WeldselectWA-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[WhatsApp]" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" value="{{ form.WhatsApp | escape }}"></div></div>
      <label for="WeldselectProduct-{{ section.id }}">Product Interested</label><select id="WeldselectProduct-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[Product Interested]"><option>Laser welding / need advice</option>{% for name in machine_names %}<option>{{ name }}</option>{% endfor %}<option>Other welding requirements</option></select>
      <label for="WeldselectMessage-{{ section.id }}">Message *</label><textarea id="WeldselectMessage-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[body]" rows="5" placeholder="Metal grade, thickness, joint design, required weld finish, output target and destination country..." required>{{ form.body | escape }}</textarea><button type="submit" class="dd-weldselect__button">Send Inquiry</button>
    {% endform %}
  </div></section></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"CollectionPage","@id":{{ canonical_url | append: '#collection' | json }},"url":{{ canonical_url | json }},"name":{{ collection.title | json }},"description":{{ collection.description | strip_html | json }}}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":{{ request.origin | append: routes.root_url | json }}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":{{ collection.title | json }},"item":{{ canonical_url | json }}}]}</script>{% stylesheet %}
